# ── Local tidy (2026-06-25): hide scattered LOCAL-ONLY test/seed/demo/scratch so
# `git status` shows only project runtime. Files stay on disk — delete anytime.
# NOTE: the CI suite is intentionally NOT hidden (backend/tests/, golden/,
# regression_filter_matrix.py, _normalize_sql.py, test_snowflake_*.py,
# test_explore_dashboard_parity.py, seed_snowflake_ci|manual_fixture.py) — it's
# meant to be COMMITTED for CI, so it stays visible. Only true throwaway here. ──
*.stackdump
overview-snap.yml
DA-Test/
mobile/
# `e2e/` is NOT ignored wholesale: the Playwright project is tracked code.
# Its local-only parts (node_modules, .auth, .env, test-results, reports,
# _*.mjs, shots) are ignored individually further up, and the specs, config
# and package.json are re-included there. A bare `e2e/` here re-excluded the
# whole directory AFTER those negations, so the suite could not be committed
# at all — a later match wins.
# Quarantined local screenshots/debug images moved out of repo root — rm anytime
_local-shots/
# OpenMetadata upstream clone (~382MB) — reference only; the OM stack pulls the
# published image, so this is NOT needed to run. Deploy files (compose, init-db,
# gen-secrets) ARE tracked; secrets/ stays ignored (open-metadata/.gitignore).
open-metadata/openmetadata-source/
